---
layout: tool.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Keyword Density Checker — SEO Toolkit"
  description: "Analyze keyword density in your content. Find overused words, check keyword stuffing, and optimize for target keywords."
  canonical: "/tools/keyword-density-checker/"
  tool:
    slug: "keyword-density-checker"
    title: "Keyword Density Checker"
    icon: "📊"
    description: "Analyze keyword density and find overused words in your content."
  toolScript: "/assets/tools/keyword-density-checker/script.js"
---

<section class="tool-area">
  <div class="tool-container">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="kd-target">Target Keyword (optional)</label>
      <input type="text" id="kd-target" placeholder="e.g. seo tools">
      <p class="form-hint">Enter your target keyword phrase to track its density specifically.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="kd-content">Content to Analyze *</label>
      <textarea id="kd-content" rows="12" placeholder="Paste your page content, article text, or HTML here..."></textarea>
      <p class="form-hint">Paste raw text or HTML. HTML tags will be stripped automatically.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="kd-top">Top N Words</label>
      <select id="kd-top">
        <option value="10">Top 10</option>
        <option value="20" selected>Top 20</option>
        <option value="50">Top 50</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-actions">
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="analyzeDensity()">Analyze</button>
      <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="clearDensity()">Clear</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tool-output" id="kd-result">
    <h3>Analysis Results</h3>
    <div id="kd-summary" class="kd-summary"></div>
    <h4 style="margin-top:20px">Keyword Frequency Table</h4>
    <div id="kd-table"></div>
    <h4 style="margin-top:20px">Target Keyword Analysis</h4>
    <div id="kd-target-result"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <details>
    <summary>What is ideal keyword density?</summary>
    <p>There is no magic number. Historically, 1-3% was recommended, but modern SEO focuses on natural writing. Google has stated keyword density is not a direct ranking factor. Write for humans first, and ensure your target keyword appears naturally in key locations (title, H1, first paragraph).</p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>What is keyword stuffing?</summary>
    <p>Keyword stuffing is the practice of overloading a page with keywords in an unnatural way to manipulate rankings. Google's spam policies explicitly penalize this. If your keyword density exceeds 5% for a single phrase, you're likely over-optimizing.</p>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Should I focus on single keywords or phrases?</summary>
    <p>Focus on long-tail keyword phrases (2-4 words) that match user intent. Single-word keywords are too broad and competitive. Long-tail phrases have lower search volume but higher conversion rates and are easier to rank for.</p>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
.kd-summary {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.kd-stat {
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 12px;
  text-align: center;
}
.kd-stat .label { font-size: 0.8em; color: var(--muted); }
.kd-stat .value { font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 4px; }
#kd-table table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 0.9em;
}
#kd-table th, #kd-table td {
  padding: 8px 12px;
  text-align: left;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
#kd-table th {
  background: var(--card-bg);
  font-weight: 600;
}
#kd-table .bar-cell { width: 30%; }
.density-bar {
  height: 18px;
  background: var(--primary);
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: width 0.3s;
}
.density-bar.warn { background: var(--warning); }
.density-bar.danger { background: var(--error); }
.kd-target-box {
  padding: 16px;
  background: var(--card-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}
.kd-target-box .highlight { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.2em; }
</style>

<script>
function clearDensity() {
  document.getElementById("kd-content").value = "";
  document.getElementById("kd-target").value = "";
  document.getElementById("kd-summary").innerHTML = "";
  document.getElementById("kd-table").innerHTML = "";
  document.getElementById("kd-target-result").innerHTML = "";
}
</script>
